    qa:note "Dev in progress. The daemon-layer fork at dispatch_delivery.rs is gone (dispatch_send now routes purely on Local/Remote via route_send_request and calls one function unconditionally), but the same acknowledges_message_id.is_some() && source_remote_host.is_none() check now lives inside crates/atm-core/src/send/mod.rs:371 (execute_outbound_send_with_runtime_and_post_send_emitter), branching to ack_mail_with_runtime_and_post_send_emitter vs send_mail_with_runtime_and_post_send_emitter before any single canonical decision. Sprint's stated job (collapse dispatch routing / delete this fork) is not complete -- the defect was moved across the atm-daemon/atm-core boundary, not eliminated." .

